Hello all,

The experimental function \fp_(g)set_from_dim:Nn (and variants) is
deprecated and marked for removal from expl3 at the end of 2015. The
recommended replacement is

  \fp_set:Nn <fp> { \dim_to_fp:n { <dimexpr> } }
